    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BackStreet is a 3D action rogue-lite game that combines fast-paced, stylish combo action with strategic growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/6d130b64e3bc1e43ecb78c9e63efd65e.poster.avif?t=1744791823\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/6d130b64e3bc1e43ecb78c9e63efd65e.webm?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/e3481cbf1f9e8c1a45558d5d4c6d4f87.poster.avif?t=1744791823\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/e3481cbf1f9e8c1a45558d5d4c6d4f87.webm?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/e3481cbf1f9e8c1a45558d5d4c6d4f87.mp4?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a city devastated by environmental pollution using a combination of normal, dash, and jump attacks to adapt to enemy patterns and engage in dynamic combat. Battle against the corrupted machines of 3COS, acquire new skills, and develop your own unique fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/99c1ce34195c375a9cf3478e09c0ff0a.poster.avif?t=1744791823\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/99c1ce34195c375a9cf3478e09c0ff0a.webm?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/60df6d041a69630b1a60c3efefe6f22f.poster.avif?t=1744791823\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/60df6d041a69630b1a60c3efefe6f22f.webm?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/60df6d041a69630b1a60c3efefe6f22f.mp4?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies grants you boosterchips, a core mechanic for customizing your combat style. By analyzing data obtained from the wreckage of robots, you can inflict various deadly debuffs on your opponents. Optimize your combination of attacks and debuffs to enhance your abilities and uncover the truth behind your lost identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/3375b99dba3a6a0c3a9e1d28b366bfc7.poster.avif?t=1744791823\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/3375b99dba3a6a0c3a9e1d28b366bfc7.webm?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/2ff31943f1619fc94b6878ef33f1b70e.poster.avif?t=1744791823\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/2ff31943f1619fc94b6878ef33f1b70e.webm?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/2ff31943f1619fc94b6878ef33f1b70e.mp4?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Earth rendered uninhabitable for humans, only the dispatched robots remain, striving to restore what was lost. Defeat 3COS, the AI ruler of the city, and uncover the real story of both humanity and yourself.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BackStreet is a 3D action rogue-lite game that combines fast-paced, stylish combo action with strategic growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/6d130b64e3bc1e43ecb78c9e63efd65e.poster.avif?t=1744791823\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/6d130b64e3bc1e43ecb78c9e63efd65e.webm?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/e3481cbf1f9e8c1a45558d5d4c6d4f87.poster.avif?t=1744791823\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/e3481cbf1f9e8c1a45558d5d4c6d4f87.webm?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/e3481cbf1f9e8c1a45558d5d4c6d4f87.mp4?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a city devastated by environmental pollution using a combination of normal, dash, and jump attacks to adapt to enemy patterns and engage in dynamic combat. Battle against the corrupted machines of 3COS, acquire new skills, and develop your own unique fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/99c1ce34195c375a9cf3478e09c0ff0a.poster.avif?t=1744791823\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/99c1ce34195c375a9cf3478e09c0ff0a.webm?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/60df6d041a69630b1a60c3efefe6f22f.poster.avif?t=1744791823\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/60df6d041a69630b1a60c3efefe6f22f.webm?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/60df6d041a69630b1a60c3efefe6f22f.mp4?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies grants you boosterchips, a core mechanic for customizing your combat style. By analyzing data obtained from the wreckage of robots, you can inflict various deadly debuffs on your opponents. Optimize your combination of attacks and debuffs to enhance your abilities and uncover the truth behind your lost identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/3375b99dba3a6a0c3a9e1d28b366bfc7.poster.avif?t=1744791823\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/3375b99dba3a6a0c3a9e1d28b366bfc7.webm?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/2ff31943f1619fc94b6878ef33f1b70e.poster.avif?t=1744791823\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/2ff31943f1619fc94b6878ef33f1b70e.webm?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121410/extras/2ff31943f1619fc94b6878ef33f1b70e.mp4?t=1744791823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Earth rendered uninhabitable for humans, only the dispatched robots remain, striving to restore what was lost. Defeat 3COS, the AI ruler of the city, and uncover the real story of both humanity and yourself.</p>",
    "short_description": "BackStreet is a 3D action roguelite game that combines dynamic combo-based combat with deep strategic elements, all with simple controls. Stand against the tyranny of the corrupted city management AI, 3COS, in a world abandoned by humans due to environmental devastation.",
